## Artifact hygiene

`artifacts/progress/c23/current-verification/` contains raw local logs, SQLite databases, and old screenshots. It must not be staged wholesale. The scoped commit should include this sanitized `verification.log`, C23 implementation/tests, ADR/runbook, and task fact sources only.

## Residual risks

- C23 target validation is lexical and descriptor-only by design. Future live execution adapters need DNS rebinding/private-network resolution checks at execution time.
- `VITE_NEXORA_API_BASE_URL` can point Mission Control at a configured control API; deployment config must preserve server-side descriptor-only behavior.
- C23-specific rate limiting is not implemented in this stage; RBAC and idempotency constrain impact, but route throttling should be added before exposing live execution surfaces.
